-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source    The marker data of the aion2-interactive-map project by tc-imba:
          https://github.com/aion2-interactive-map/aion2-interactive-map
          verteron.json is adapted from public/data/markers/World_L_A.yaml and
          altgard.json from public/data/markers/World_D_A.yaml; the category tree follows
          public/data/types.yaml. Both files match the upstream markers as of upstream commit
          d5a1863 (2025-12-03).
          Their gathering points (the "gathering" category and its children) are adapted from
          the same project's marker data as its site serves it, which carries markers the
          repository does not: https://data-aion2.tc-imba.com/markers/World_L_A.json and
          World_D_A.json, with the resource names from locales/en-US/types.json there,
          retrieved on 2026-10-02 by scripts/import_gathering.py.

